# ==============================================================
# STAGING LOAD — SINGLE TABLE ROW HASH DAILY RUN
#
# DAILY PRODUCTION-STYLE TEST
#
# RAW vs PREV_RAW Change Detection
# + Corrected ROW HASH
# + Existing ROW_HASH excluded from new hash
# + Datatype alignment
# + Deterministic hash column order
# + Canonical JSON hash
# + Retry Mechanism
# + ThreadPoolExecutor
# + Staging Daily/Final Logs
# + PREV_RAW_SNAPSHOT Backup Before PREV_RAW Overwrite
# + CST/CDT Log Timestamps
# + UTC/GMT Log Timestamps
#
# DAILY FLOW:
#
# TODAY RAW
#       |
#       v
# Compare against PREV_RAW
#       |
#       +---- I
#       +---- U
#       +---- D
#       |
#       v
# STAGING
#       |
# Snapshot OLD PREV_RAW
#       |
#       v
# TODAY RAW becomes NEW PREV_RAW
#
# NO SNAPSHOT RESTORE DURING DAILY RUN
# ==============================================================


